meta {
  name: Onboarding - Start
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/start
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Called when the wizard opens. A user with no workspace (and not invited
  into one) gets their own, on the Free plan, named after the company in a
  work email (`jane@northwind.io` → "Northwind") or "Jane's workspace".
  Calling it again changes nothing.

  Response is wrapped: `{ success, statusCode, message, data }` where `data`
  is the full onboarding state (same shape as `Onboarding - Get State`).
}
